Error [jet.ReturnTypeMismatch]: This value is `Unit`, but `old_seal` returns Bool FileCryptoError!
  --> files_sealed_seal_bool.jet:7:19
    |
  7 |     return sealed.seal(recipients, source, destination)
    |                   ^^^^
 Why: `old_seal` declares Bool FileCryptoError! as its result, so the value it hands back must be Bool FileCryptoError!
 Fix: Hand back a Bool FileCryptoError! value: convert this value to Bool FileCryptoError!, or return the value you meant
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0113
